      "px": 200,
      "py": 150,
      "panelOpen": false,
      "text": "BGP-Test (komplex): 10 Router, 10 autonome Systeme\n\nTier-1-Backbone: AS65001 (R1) ─── AS65002 (R2)\n                      │   ╲      ╱   │    ╲\nRegionale ISPs:  AS65003(R3) AS65004(R4) AS65005(R5)\n                    │   ╲      │    ╲      │    ╲\nKunden-AS:    R6(65006) R7(65007) R8(65008) R9(65009) R10(65010)\n\nR7 ist dual-homed: eBGP-Peers zu R3 (AS65003) und R4 (AS65004).\nStub-Netze: 10.6.0.0/24 · 10.7.0.0/24 · 10.8.0.0/24 · 10.9.0.0/24 · 10.10.0.0/24\nR1 und R2 initiieren alle Sessions (niedrigste AS-Nummer)."
    },
